    UIValidationTests       : 25 tests
    CrudOperationsTests     : 20 tests
    InputValidationTests    : 15 tests
    ErrorHandlingTests      : 15 tests
    SessionManagementTests  : 15 tests
    FileUploadTests         : 10 tests
    AccessibilityTests      : 15 tests
    ResponsiveDesignTests   : 20 tests
    PerformanceSmokeTests   : 20 tests
    RegressionTests         : 20 tests
